{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inner Voice is a first-person, exploration-driven adventure where you explore strange, dreamlike places, solve story puzzles and make choices that change what you learn. A mysterious voice, Magnus White, guides you and haunts you as you move through a dark world shaped by grief, memory and silence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/extras/52dc2880c4fc438ec8266f69a28433f8.poster.avif?t=1773320705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/extras/52dc2880c4fc438ec8266f69a28433f8.webm?t=1773320705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/extras/52dc2880c4fc438ec8266f69a28433f8.mp4?t=1773320705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>This is a slow-burning game. Take your time, look closely and put the story together at your own pace through hidden details, symbols and moments that don\u2019t feel quite right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a haunting world that mixes Victorian and Western themes. You\u2019ll travel through abandoned spaces and surreal locations, following subtle clues that slowly reveal a bigger mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/extras/76d10aa1955380cff2582f0b4174c884.poster.avif?t=1773320705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/extras/76d10aa1955380cff2582f0b4174c884.webm?t=1773320705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/extras/76d10aa1955380cff2582f0b4174c884.mp4?t=1773320705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Booker, a man searching for answers after his wife's disappearance. Along the way, Magnus speaks to you, guiding you, questioning you and revealing fragments of truth as the world unfolds around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magnus\u2019 voice lies at the heart of the experience, shaping how the story is told.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move forward, the voice becomes both a guide and a presence, driving the events that lead you toward your final chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices affect how the story ends, leading to multiple endings, including a hidden secret ending for those willing to listen closely.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/extras/387d341170954bb2f60dbc806eb90ee3.poster.avif?t=1773320705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/extras/387d341170954bb2f60dbc806eb90ee3.webm?t=1773320705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/extras/387d341170954bb2f60dbc806eb90ee3.mp4?t=1773320705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location, object and artwork helps reveal the bigger mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Voice-Led Storytelling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious voice guides your journey through narration and voice-over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles by observing, understanding symbols and finding hidden clues.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personal, Emotional Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about loss and memory told through discovery, not action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape the path you take, including a secret ending for careful players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/extras/8712f26f2345cba54bf043a0433aa7ff.avif?t=1773320705\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/extras/6d7855be7e4a59518181c03e2a6bdd95.avif?t=1773320705\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/extras/8f88b865810e03af0c6aa93f60d37a8c.avif?t=1773320705\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>Developer's Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a solo-developed project. <br>Take your time, explore carefully, and let the atmosphere guide you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139880?t=1773320705","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139880?t=1773320705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/941cdad108c1c04c9e1a4c4d8730f11ae8e3a0a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773320705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139880/941cdad108c1c04c9e1a4c4d8730f11ae8e3a0a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773320705","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptor